    {
      "id": "b87ba9fb-364d-4eee-99bd-74fb1fb09794",
      "name": "Sticky Note b87ba9fb",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Old Lead Revival\n\nEvery weekday morning it finds HubSpot leads with no activity for 90+ days (and not opted out), writes a short personal check-in with AI, and asks your team to approve each one in Slack before anything is sent. Approved emails go out from Gmail and are logged on the HubSpot contact, which also stops the same lead coming back tomorrow. When a lead replies, the rep is alerted.\n\n**Safety:** daily cap (default 15), human approval on every email, opt-out line in every email, unanswered approvals expire after 24h.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit **Revival Settings**\n2. Connect HubSpot, Anthropic, Slack, Gmail and Google Sheets\n3. Create `#lead-revival` and `#automation-alerts` in Slack",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 500
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "816014f7-48d6-492b-8dd2-03cbc76347ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note 816014f7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
